WEBVTT

00:13.130 --> 00:16.470
<b><i>Frankly, dropping out of school isn't the best idea.</i></b>

00:16.640 --> 00:18.810
<b><i>Can't we at least finish the year?</i></b>

00:19.220 --> 00:21.100
<b><i>The owner of the venue told us</i></b>

00:21.270 --> 00:24.520
<b><i>that people fail because</i></b>

00:24.690 --> 00:27.610
<b><i>they hesitate too long.</i></b>

00:28.060 --> 00:30.780
<b><i>Have you thought about how our parents will take it?</i></b>

00:30.940 --> 00:33.950
<b><i>- And a gap year?
- It's a good compromise.</i></b>

00:34.110 --> 00:36.910
<b><i>We record an album and boom, back to school.</i></b>

00:37.200 --> 00:38.370
<b><i>No way.</i></b>

00:38.780 --> 00:41.290
<b><i>I swear, we're going to make it.</i></b>

00:41.450 --> 00:43.330
<b><i>You heard the agency.</i></b>

00:43.500 --> 00:45.670
<b><i>We're a revolutionary band</i></b>

00:46.170 --> 00:48.630
<b><i>that’s going to shake up all of Tokyo.</i></b>

00:48.790 --> 00:50.670
<b><i>And she’s going to help us do it.</i></b>

00:51.050 --> 00:53.210
<b><i>It's not going to happen just like that.</i></b>

00:53.380 --> 00:54.630
<b><i>I think so too.</i></b>

00:54.800 --> 00:57.720
<b><i>They didn’t tell us to drop out of school, right?</i></b>

00:57.890 --> 00:58.680
<b><i>You see.</i></b>

01:00.390 --> 01:02.680
<b><i>Maybe, but we have to give it a shot.</i></b>

01:04.850 --> 01:06.190
<b><i>I admire your confidence.</i></b>

01:06.520 --> 01:09.770
<b><i>We tend to want to escape through the first exit.</i></b>

01:09.940 --> 01:13.690
<b><i>The more we create escape routes, the less we hold on.</i></b>

01:14.780 --> 01:15.450
<b><i>Okay, but…</i></b>

01:17.780 --> 01:21.330
<b><i>That's why we mustn’t give ourselves any way out!</i></b>

01:21.950 --> 01:23.080
<b><i>Momoka.</i></b>

01:24.660 --> 01:27.120
<b><i>Hey, what are you doing?</i></b>

01:31.880 --> 01:34.550
<b><i>To the Budokan!</i></b>

01:32.000 --> 01:34.880
<b><i>We're going to make it, I’m telling you!</i></b>

01:38.260 --> 01:41.600
<b>Hey… anyone need a bathroom break?</b>

01:42.760 --> 01:44.970
<b>We're talking to you, Momoka.</b>

01:45.390 --> 01:45.980
<b>Shut up.</b>

01:46.310 --> 01:47.730
<b>Come on, answer her.</b>

01:50.060 --> 01:51.190
<b>You'll see!</b>

01:51.520 --> 01:54.190
<b>Don’t provoke him!</b>

01:57.200 --> 01:58.240
<b>Take the exit.</b>

01:58.490 --> 01:59.530
<b>Noted.</b>

03:31.790 --> 03:33.080
<b>Start by apologizing.</b>

03:32.210 --> 03:36.290
<b>**IF YOU NEED TO CRY**</b>

03:33.250 --> 03:33.960
<b>What?</b>

03:34.420 --> 03:35.880
<b>She's right.</b>

03:36.590 --> 03:38.840
<b>Are you kidding? You're defending her?</b>

03:39.210 --> 03:40.720
<b>I’m not taking sides.</b>

03:40.880 --> 03:43.840
<b>But that wasn't the place to talk about something like that.</b>

03:44.220 --> 03:46.550
<b>The stage is for the audience.</b>

03:46.720 --> 03:48.310
<b>A sacred place.</b>

03:48.470 --> 03:51.480
<b>It's not the place to spill your guts!</b>

03:51.890 --> 03:53.980
<b>Of course it is,</b>

03:54.900 --> 03:55.860
<b>because then you were ready to listen to me!</b>

03:59.070 --> 04:01.360
<b>Sit down, everyone is watching.</b>

04:01.650 --> 04:04.860
<b>Easy for you to say, Subaru. You could have intervened!</b>

04:05.240 --> 04:08.030
<b>Me? I couldn’t do anything.</b>

04:08.200 --> 04:10.870
<b>This is embarrassing. I'll wait for you in the car.</b>

04:12.580 --> 04:15.500
<b>We don't let internal conflicts escalate.</b>

04:16.840 --> 04:19.130
<b>This is all your fault, Momoka.</b>

04:19.340 --> 04:20.130
<b>My fault?</b>

04:20.300 --> 04:21.260
<b>Yes, yours!</b>

04:21.590 --> 04:25.390
<b>You blurted out that you wanted to quit just like that!</b>

04:25.680 --> 04:29.510
<b>And you decided we’d make a career on your own.</b>

04:29.850 --> 04:31.810
<b>The blame is shared.</b>

04:32.850 --> 04:35.730
<b>You’re the one who complicated the whole situation!</b>

04:35.900 --> 04:36.860
<b>Sorry.</b>

04:37.150 --> 04:38.020
<b>Anyway,</b>

04:38.570 --> 04:39.770
<b>I’m not giving up.</b>

04:40.150 --> 04:42.400
<b>Get mad on your own if you want,</b>

04:42.570 --> 04:44.030
<b>but you’ll regret it.</b>

04:44.400 --> 04:47.780
<b>You don’t realize the extent of Diamond Dust’s success.</b>

04:48.120 --> 04:52.000
<b>That doesn’t mean we should give up.</b>

04:52.370 --> 04:54.290
<b>I don’t want us</b>

04:54.620 --> 04:55.920
<b>to quit before trying.</b>

04:57.580 --> 04:58.920
<b>Be realistic.</b>

04:59.090 --> 05:02.920
<b>You're the one avoiding reality, not me.</b>

05:03.090 --> 05:04.300
<b>You’re annoying.</b>

05:04.470 --> 05:06.800
<b>You don’t know anything about me!</b>

05:07.090 --> 05:10.680
<b>Then talk, go ahead. Why did you start a band?</b>

05:11.180 --> 05:13.850
<b>Why didn’t you go back to your countryside</b>

05:14.020 --> 05:16.190
<b>if you think your music is pointless?</b>

05:16.640 --> 05:18.190
<b>Why persist?</b>

05:19.860 --> 05:22.650
<b>In any case, you shouldn’t drop out of school.</b>

05:24.240 --> 05:25.070
<b>It’s my choice.</b>

05:27.570 --> 05:29.280
<b>You’re right, do what you want.</b>

05:32.450 --> 05:33.830
<b>You’re at it again?</b>

05:36.120 --> 05:37.500
<b>Stop running away!</b>

05:39.710 --> 05:40.710
<b>Will you shut up?</b>

05:41.170 --> 05:42.750
<b>Don’t panic!</b>

05:42.920 --> 05:45.880
<b>It's a show! We're filming a scene for a series!</b>

05:46.220 --> 05:47.510
<b>Real fanatics.</b>

05:47.880 --> 05:48.890
<b>Or idiots.</b>

05:49.180 --> 05:52.140
<b>Hit me if that’s what you want. I’m used to it.</b>

05:52.890 --> 05:54.140
<b>Do it, let's get it over with.</b>

05:54.470 --> 05:57.390
<b>You’ll finally give me a reason to hate you.</b>

05:58.480 --> 06:00.150
<b>Because you'll be like them.</b>

06:10.870 --> 06:12.160
<b>A glass of water?</b>

06:12.950 --> 06:14.160
<b>There, it’s done.</b>

06:14.580 --> 06:16.000
<b>It's just beginning.</b>

06:17.330 --> 06:18.870
<b>Thanks for bringing me back.</b>

06:19.040 --> 06:20.710
<b>We'll call soon.</b>

06:22.880 --> 06:25.420
<b>Finally free from that stifling atmosphere.</b>

06:32.470 --> 06:33.220
<b>Hey.</b>

06:33.720 --> 06:34.760
<b>What?</b>

06:35.180 --> 06:36.850
<b>Where did that guitar come from?</b>

06:37.270 --> 06:39.140
<b>I was given it when we left.</b>

06:39.940 --> 06:40.900
<b>It's a gift?</b>

06:41.350 --> 06:42.480
<b>A problem?</b>

06:43.820 --> 06:47.110
<b>Mine gave her one of the guitars she wasn’t using anymore.</b>

06:47.360 --> 06:50.660
<b>She said she wasn't doing much with her voice.</b>

06:50.990 --> 06:53.990
<b>That you were similar, and that you should hang in there.</b>

06:56.700 --> 06:57.450
<b>Thanks, really.</b>

06:57.620 --> 07:01.290
<b>I told my buddy you’d bring back the car.</b>

07:01.670 --> 07:03.250
<b>OK, no worries.</b>

07:03.420 --> 07:06.800
<b>Well, I'll get off here too.</b>

07:06.960 --> 07:08.050
<b>I can give you a ride.</b>

07:09.670 --> 07:11.630
<b>Forget it, with the traffic.</b>

07:11.800 --> 07:13.050
<b>There are still subways.</b>

07:13.510 --> 07:16.850
<b>Don’t forget your meds for motion sickness.</b>

07:17.100 --> 07:18.560
<b>Leave me alone.</b>

07:18.930 --> 07:21.810
<b>- See you soon.
- Be careful on the road!</b>

07:23.520 --> 07:25.610
<b>Are there really still subways running?</b>

07:25.940 --> 07:26.860
<b>No.</b>

07:27.360 --> 07:29.440
<b>But I wanted to talk.</b>

07:29.610 --> 07:31.780
<b>I was trying to be discreet.</b>

07:34.070 --> 07:37.240
<b>Still, it feels nice, in this kind of apartment.</b>

07:37.490 --> 07:38.700
<b>I'm going to move in here.</b>

07:39.120 --> 07:40.710
<b>Should I let you know if it becomes available?</b>

07:41.040 --> 07:44.920
<b>Hmm, I’ll think twice if you’re my roommate.</b>

07:45.290 --> 07:46.460
<b>Oh, not nice.</b>

07:47.960 --> 07:51.970
<b>Did Rupa and Tomo suspect what Nina was planning?</b>

07:52.260 --> 07:53.220
<b>I doubt it.</b>

07:53.550 --> 07:58.010
<b>But they probably weren’t surprised, given Nina's behavior.</b>

07:58.260 --> 08:01.100
<b>You’re the only one who didn't notice anything.</b>

08:02.770 --> 08:04.270
<b>You should have stopped her.</b>

08:04.440 --> 08:05.860
<b>She does what she wants.</b>

08:06.190 --> 08:10.610
<b>You know very well it was super risky.</b>

08:11.070 --> 08:14.320
<b>We haven’t even released any music yet.</b>

08:14.780 --> 08:16.990
<b>But the festival accepted our registration.</b>

08:17.450 --> 08:22.040
<b>And Rupa’s work caught the eye of a label.</b>

08:22.290 --> 08:22.960
<b>Really?</b>

08:23.330 --> 08:25.750
<b>It may sound crazy to you,</b>

08:26.080 --> 08:29.670
<b>but remember you were part of Diamond Dust.</b>

08:29.960 --> 08:31.380
<b>As for Rupa and Tomo,</b>

08:31.550 --> 08:35.260
<b>they’re a duo making a sensation online.</b>

08:35.640 --> 08:37.220
<b>And to top it off,</b>

08:37.390 --> 08:40.890
<b>a certain singer posted that she liked Nina’s voice.</b>

08:41.430 --> 08:42.890
<b>It got people talking.</b>

08:43.060 --> 08:43.890
<b>For real?</b>

08:44.230 --> 08:46.520
<b>Plus, we gained a ton of followers.</b>

08:46.940 --> 08:50.400
<b>And based on the feedback, we’re the group everyone’s most</b>

08:51.480 --> 08:52.650
<b>looking forward to seeing perform next.</b>

08:53.530 --> 08:54.400
<b>No way.</b>

08:54.740 --> 08:57.620
<b>Nina isn’t disconnected from reality, you know.</b>

08:58.030 --> 09:00.240
<b>We’re not competing with Diamond Dust yet,</b>

09:00.490 --> 09:03.410
<b>but we can at least try to make a start.</b>

09:03.910 --> 09:05.920
<b>And Rupa and Tomo, what about them?</b>

09:06.080 --> 09:08.840
<b>They’ve always wanted to make a living from music.</b>

09:09.250 --> 09:10.250
<b>And you?</b>

09:10.420 --> 09:12.050
<b>Personally, I don't care.</b>

09:12.460 --> 09:15.550
<b>One thing’s for sure, we’re going to grow up one day.</b>

09:16.890 --> 09:19.100
<b>The rest is up to you.</b>

09:19.720 --> 09:23.100
<b>So, if I sum it up, everyone was on the same page.</b>

09:23.930 --> 09:25.350
<b>Not exactly.</b>

09:25.520 --> 09:27.650
<b>But Nina keeps saying the same thing.</b>

09:27.980 --> 09:31.650
<b>We need to set goals and stick to them.</b>

09:32.940 --> 09:36.450
<b><i>That’s why we mustn’t give ourselves any way out!</i></b>

09:39.820 --> 09:42.450
<b>Let’s see… if I take this one…</b>

09:43.240 --> 09:43.950
<b>And, uh…</b>

09:44.500 --> 09:45.460
<b>with that?</b>

09:45.910 --> 09:48.210
<b>Well, that should do.</b>

09:50.540 --> 09:51.840
<b>La minor.</b>

09:52.920 --> 09:54.010
<b>Fa.</b>

09:55.340 --> 09:56.550
<b>Sol.</b>

09:57.800 --> 10:00.390
<b>Frankly, it’s impossible.</b>

10:00.550 --> 10:01.470
<b>Let’s see…</b>

10:03.140 --> 10:07.980
<b><i>Freedom, freedom I feel liberated</i></b>

10:08.140 --> 10:12.940
<b><i>Tomorrow and the day after I’ll do as I please</i></b>

10:13.110 --> 10:13.940
<b>Tada!</b>

10:16.490 --> 10:17.570
<b><i>Dad.</i></b>

10:18.070 --> 10:20.120
<b><i>Thank you for taking such good care of me.</i></b>

10:20.740 --> 10:23.080
<b><i>From now on, I’ll manage on my own.</i></b>

10:23.700 --> 10:25.540
<b><i>Don’t send me any more money.</i></b>

10:26.250 --> 10:28.500
<b><i>I’m returning my bank book.</i></b>

10:28.870 --> 10:29.710
<b><i>Nina.</i></b>

10:30.040 --> 10:31.880
<b><i>Muneo Iseri</i></b>

10:38.130 --> 10:39.340
<b>Step right up, step right up!</b>

10:39.760 --> 10:40.590
<b>We’re not at the market.</b>

10:40.760 --> 10:42.300
<b>What, shouldn’t I?</b>

10:42.470 --> 10:44.390
<b>Just say hello.</b>

10:44.560 --> 10:46.100
<b>You know the place.</b>

10:46.270 --> 10:49.100
<b>We don't really pay attention to the details</b>

10:49.270 --> 10:51.350
<b>when we're customers.</b>

10:51.980 --> 10:52.860
<b>Yum.</b>

10:53.190 --> 10:54.730
<b>Eat and you're fired.</b>

10:54.900 --> 10:55.860
<b>Oh yeah?</b>

10:56.320 --> 10:57.440
<b>What did you think?</b>

10:57.610 --> 11:00.740
<b>What did you expect when you applied here, huh?</b>

11:00.910 --> 11:04.830
<b>It’s my first job, I wanted familiar ground.</b>

11:04.990 --> 11:06.370
<b>Well, get moving!</b>

11:06.620 --> 11:08.870
<b>We asked for the bill ages ago.</b>

11:09.210 --> 11:10.210
<b>My apologies.</b>

11:11.170 --> 11:12.750
<b>Where are you from, anyway?</b>

11:13.080 --> 11:15.750
<b>Foreigners shouldn’t get cocky.</b>

11:16.090 --> 11:16.920
<b>That’s enough.</b>

11:17.420 --> 11:18.630
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

11:18.920 --> 11:19.840
<b>Just be careful.</b>

11:21.050 --> 11:22.760
<b>Thank you for coming.</b>

11:23.970 --> 11:24.930
<b>Rupa…</b>

11:25.350 --> 11:27.770
<b>Don’t worry, it happens all the time.</b>

11:31.640 --> 11:34.360
<b>I need to be more rock too.</b>

11:35.610 --> 11:37.110
<b>I'll check the stock.</b>

11:38.860 --> 11:41.360
<b>How are things between you and Momoka?</b>

11:41.910 --> 11:43.530
<b>Nowhere, actually.</b>

11:43.950 --> 11:47.040
<b>It would definitely escalate if we tried to talk.</b>

11:47.450 --> 11:52.040
<b>Just so you know, if things don’t improve, we’re out.</b>

11:53.000 --> 11:53.920
<b>I know.</b>

11:55.670 --> 11:58.590
<b>That’s right, come closer…</b>

12:00.170 --> 12:01.300
<b>A medium combo.</b>

12:01.630 --> 12:02.800
<b>Hello!</b>

12:03.550 --> 12:04.680
<b>A medium combo!</b>

12:09.850 --> 12:11.520
<b>A beer with that?</b>

12:12.140 --> 12:12.770
<b>Nina.</b>

12:13.480 --> 12:14.810
<b>Anything else?</b>

12:15.150 --> 12:16.730
<b>Do you have a moment?</b>

12:17.770 --> 12:18.860
<b>I think…</b>

12:19.650 --> 12:20.280
<b>yes.</b>

12:21.860 --> 12:23.320
<b><i>Girls Band Cry.</i></b>

12:24.910 --> 12:27.950
<b><i>Alright, there was no harassment.</i></b>

12:28.870 --> 12:31.660
<b><i>Just a small incident that escalated.</i></b>

12:32.080 --> 12:34.040
<b><i>Can we close the case?</i></b>

12:36.170 --> 12:37.130
<b><i>Perfect.</i></b>

12:37.420 --> 12:39.670
<b><i>Apologize and shake hands</i></b>

12:40.170 --> 12:43.760
<b><i>like adults.</i></b>

12:48.180 --> 12:49.180
<b><i>Iseri?</i></b>

12:55.770 --> 12:56.940
<b>Where are we going?</b>

12:58.400 --> 13:00.360
<b>Just a bit of patience, it’s nearby.</b>

13:01.570 --> 13:02.690
<b>Alright.</b>

13:03.240 --> 13:04.700
<b>Did you have something in mind?</b>

13:04.950 --> 13:05.780
<b>Not particularly.</b>

13:06.110 --> 13:10.080
<b>You’re not too bad at driving the van.</b>

13:18.960 --> 13:19.710
<b>They’re pushing it.</b>

13:20.130 --> 13:24.220
<b>The least they could do is keep us informed.</b>

13:24.630 --> 13:25.760
<b>Don’t worry.</b>

13:27.180 --> 13:30.470
<b>The opposite of love is indifference.</b>

13:30.810 --> 13:34.560
<b>If they want to get back together after a fight like that,</b>

13:35.190 --> 13:36.640
<b>it’s for a reason.</b>

13:38.520 --> 13:39.900
<b>Because they’re idiots.</b>

13:43.490 --> 13:45.150
<b>Is this where you wanted to take me?</b>

13:45.320 --> 13:47.110
<b>Come on, open the door.</b>

13:47.280 --> 13:52.540
<b><i>What can I rely on to guide myself?</i></b>

13:52.700 --> 13:55.750
<b><i>I just need to follow the manual of common sense</i></b>

13:55.910 --> 13:58.330
<b><i>And all its meaningless words.</i></b>

13:58.500 --> 14:00.250
<b><i>Days pass and are all the same.</i></b>

14:00.710 --> 14:02.210
<b>Diamond Dust.</b>

14:03.340 --> 14:07.010
<b>That’s right, refusing fallback options.</b>

14:07.380 --> 14:11.050
<b>We can't just sing what we like.</b>

14:11.300 --> 14:12.760
<b>To survive,</b>

14:13.140 --> 14:17.770
<b>we need to watch for tomorrow’s hits, produce things that sell,</b>

14:18.350 --> 14:20.360
<b>things that are trendy.</b>

14:21.230 --> 14:23.780
<b>That’s not a universal truth.</b>

14:25.400 --> 14:28.280
<b>Only a handful of artists</b>

14:29.360 --> 14:31.030
<b>produce what they love.</b>

14:31.620 --> 14:34.040
<b>**ENOUGH WITH PLAYING THE FAN**</b>

14:32.160 --> 14:34.580
<b>Even the original members of DD</b>

14:34.200 --> 14:36.620
<b>**I HATE THE SINGER DD IS DEAD**</b>

14:34.910 --> 14:37.290
<b>didn’t want to go down that path.</b>

14:36.790 --> 14:39.370
<b>**THE BAND IS DOOMED WITHOUT MOMOKA**</b>

14:37.620 --> 14:42.170
<b>But to survive, they had to sell.</b>

14:44.340 --> 14:48.930
<b>Maybe, but your music can touch people.</b>

14:49.430 --> 14:52.260
<b>Yet, you abandoned your compositions</b>

14:52.430 --> 14:55.060
<b>and left the band without even trying.</b>

14:55.430 --> 14:58.310
<b>But now, they've found their audience.</b>

14:58.850 --> 15:01.230
<b>They were right.</b>

15:02.190 --> 15:03.690
<b>At first, they were adamant.</b>

15:04.440 --> 15:06.740
<b>No playing it conventional.</b>

15:07.030 --> 15:09.070
<b>We’d compose our own songs.</b>

15:09.700 --> 15:11.660
<b>But no one cared.</b>

15:12.410 --> 15:13.830
<b>Sure,</b>

15:14.370 --> 15:17.330
<b>the critics loved us, but we weren’t profitable.</b>

15:18.580 --> 15:21.670
<b>Only our most clichéd songs appealed to the public.</b>

15:22.420 --> 15:23.960
<b>That’s how the world works.</b>

15:24.420 --> 15:27.460
<b>We face reality</b>

15:28.800 --> 15:30.470
<b>and have to make a choice.</b>

15:31.470 --> 15:35.260
<b>Ignoring it prevents progress.</b>

15:38.140 --> 15:40.390
<b>And they wanted to move forward.</b>

15:40.560 --> 15:43.310
<b>You can hardly blame them.</b>

15:43.900 --> 15:47.570
<b>Anyway, I don’t want you to make the same choice I did.</b>

15:48.610 --> 15:53.280
<b>You asked me why I formed a band again, right?</b>

15:53.700 --> 15:56.370
<b>When I heard you sing for the first time,</b>

15:56.530 --> 15:59.370
<b>I saw myself in my early days.</b>

16:00.080 --> 16:03.750
<b>You didn’t care about money or success.</b>

16:03.920 --> 16:06.040
<b>You just sang what you loved.</b>

16:07.170 --> 16:10.550
<b>I saw the past me that I had loved so much.</b>

16:11.220 --> 16:12.970
<b>The me that I no longer was.</b>

16:13.760 --> 16:17.510
<b>That’s why I wanted you to sing as yourself.</b>

16:18.640 --> 16:20.310
<b>Free from any constraints.</b>

16:20.520 --> 16:22.980
<b>I wanted to be able to listen to you over and over.</b>

16:23.850 --> 16:25.940
<b><i>Thank you for everything!</i></b>

16:26.820 --> 16:28.820
<b><i>We are Diamond Dust!</i></b>

16:29.280 --> 16:31.990
<b><i>Make some noise for the next band!</i></b>

16:33.950 --> 16:36.320
<b>And what about what I feel in all this?</b>

16:37.240 --> 16:38.080
<b>Nina.</b>

16:38.620 --> 16:40.580
<b>Do you ever put yourself in my shoes?</b>

16:41.870 --> 16:42.580
<b>Nina!</b>

16:46.330 --> 16:47.090
<b>Nina!</b>

16:47.420 --> 16:48.710
<b>But let me go!</b>

16:53.170 --> 16:55.470
<b>I don't belong to your memories.</b>

16:55.970 --> 16:58.470
<b>So don't condemn me to wander in them!</b>

17:00.390 --> 17:03.230
<b><i>Come on, shake hands.</i></b>

17:04.020 --> 17:08.440
<b><i>What can I rely on to guide myself?</i></b>

17:08.770 --> 17:09.730
<b><i>Iseri?</i></b>

17:12.030 --> 17:12.940
<b><i>Iseri!</i></b>

17:13.190 --> 17:14.740
<b><i>Come back, Nina!</i></b>

17:16.700 --> 17:17.990
<b><i>Everything is so white</i></b>

17:18.530 --> 17:19.740
<b><i>Everything is so slow</i></b>

17:20.330 --> 17:25.920
<b><i>All the answers are empty of substance</i></b>

17:26.670 --> 17:28.670
<b>Even if your fingers are trembling…</b>

17:29.960 --> 17:33.760
<b>your songs have given some of us the strength to live.</b>

17:34.590 --> 17:36.680
<b>What you need to pursue</b>

17:37.140 --> 17:38.930
<b>is not a vague memory of yourself.</b>

17:39.510 --> 17:42.930
<b>But your desire to share your music with the world.</b>

17:43.270 --> 17:45.520
<b>You formed this band for a reason.</b>

17:45.730 --> 17:47.350
<b>To express your emotions,</b>

17:47.600 --> 17:50.440
<b>from anger to joy to sadness.</b>

17:50.770 --> 17:54.190
<b>That's why you started singing before leaving for Tokyo!</b>

17:54.360 --> 17:55.950
<b>Why you wanted to make a living from it!</b>

17:57.530 --> 18:01.200
<b>What are you afraid of? Stop being scared!</b>

18:01.370 --> 18:02.830
<b>Look at me.</b>

18:03.080 --> 18:05.580
<b>I am one of the people</b>

18:05.750 --> 18:08.210
<b>to whom you gave the strength to fight!</b>

18:08.380 --> 18:11.460
<b>One of those who loved singing with you,</b>

18:11.630 --> 18:13.710
<b>and who would have bet everything on you!</b>

18:14.460 --> 18:17.380
<b>One of those who believe and love your music…</b>

18:19.720 --> 18:20.720
<b>Momoka.</b>

18:23.520 --> 18:25.230
<b>I'm not your excuse to run away.</b>

18:28.810 --> 18:29.770
<b>Momoka?</b>

18:30.900 --> 18:31.820
<b>No doubt about it.</b>

18:32.520 --> 18:33.610
<b>It's her.</b>

18:34.230 --> 18:35.400
<b>Come on, hurry.</b>

18:36.150 --> 18:37.110
<b>Come on, hurry up.</b>

18:38.150 --> 18:39.110
<b>Hina.</b>

18:39.490 --> 18:40.870
<b>- Move it!
- I'm coming.</b>

18:41.200 --> 18:43.830
<b>Never mind, I'm leaving. Take the train back.</b>

18:44.490 --> 18:45.290
<b>Momoka!</b>

18:45.450 --> 18:46.620
<b>Momoka!</b>

18:53.460 --> 18:55.630
<b>Don't leave me! Momoka!</b>

18:59.630 --> 19:00.510
<b>Poor idiot.</b>

19:00.680 --> 19:01.640
<b>You're crazy!</b>

19:02.470 --> 19:04.600
<b>Now we're even.</b>

19:08.060 --> 19:09.690
<b>Why do you always run away?</b>

19:10.150 --> 19:12.520
<b>You don't have to, though.</b>

19:12.810 --> 19:15.400
<b>You stayed true to yourself!</b>

19:15.690 --> 19:16.650
<b>Stop it!</b>

19:19.990 --> 19:21.360
<b>Momoka!</b>

19:36.090 --> 19:38.880
<b>We’re not asking you to really talk to us.</b>

19:39.510 --> 19:41.340
<b>Apparently, you have a band.</b>

19:41.800 --> 19:43.390
<b>We can't wait to hear it.</b>

19:44.010 --> 19:45.930
<b>You know, we don't regret anything.</b>

19:46.310 --> 19:48.430
<b>We’re determined to reach the top!</b>

19:48.770 --> 19:50.940
<b>And prove to you that you were wrong.</b>

19:51.310 --> 19:53.940
<b>We’ll do everything we can to survive.</b>

19:54.610 --> 19:57.690
<b>And we don't intend to lose without a fight.</b>

19:58.110 --> 20:01.200
<b>You’ll see, we were right.</b>

20:03.620 --> 20:06.330
<b>We’ll show you that we made the right choice!</b>

20:06.660 --> 20:07.490
<b>What?</b>

20:07.660 --> 20:09.200
<b>Don't make me laugh.</b>

20:09.660 --> 20:11.710
<b>Not much to boast about</b>

20:11.870 --> 20:14.290
<b>after such a lousy performance.</b>

20:14.630 --> 20:15.460
<b>Momoka.</b>

20:15.750 --> 20:17.250
<b>You’re a cookie-cutter band.</b>

20:17.420 --> 20:20.670
<b>The least you can do is play your part!</b>

20:20.840 --> 20:21.970
<b>Be professionals!</b>

20:22.300 --> 20:24.720
<b>We’ll be at the festival.</b>

20:25.260 --> 20:27.390
<b>Mess up like you did,</b>

20:27.600 --> 20:30.730
<b>and all your fans will drop you for us.</b>

20:34.100 --> 20:35.230
<b>What's this nonsense?</b>

20:35.770 --> 20:37.230
<b>A declaration of war.</b>

20:39.900 --> 20:41.490
<b>Momoka!</b>

20:41.860 --> 20:43.990
<b>I hear you loud and clear!</b>

20:48.910 --> 20:50.330
<b>Get in, Nina.</b>

20:55.710 --> 20:56.880
<b>Do you know her?</b>

20:57.960 --> 20:58.800
<b>Well…</b>

20:59.460 --> 21:00.880
<b>she doesn’t ring a bell.</b>

21:04.180 --> 21:05.010
<b>Damn it.</b>

21:05.430 --> 21:06.390
<b>Shit!</b>

21:08.180 --> 21:09.600
<b>What’s wrong?</b>

21:09.930 --> 21:10.850
<b>Momoka.</b>

21:11.180 --> 21:12.060
<b>What?</b>

21:12.890 --> 21:15.900
<b>No matter what… I love you.</b>

21:17.190 --> 21:18.270
<b>Whatever.</b>

21:20.440 --> 21:22.320
<b>You're so slow to catch on.</b>

21:25.110 --> 21:26.280
<b>I’m confessing my love.</b>

21:28.240 --> 21:32.160
<b><i>My fingers are static My fingers are trembling</i></b>

21:32.950 --> 21:36.290
<b><i>There are no written answers Nor any stinging failures</i></b>

21:36.460 --> 21:42.210
<b><i>I have always been who I am And I will remain who I was</i></b>

21:42.380 --> 21:48.800
<b><i>Even if I fight There will be no tomorrow</i></b>

21:53.350 --> 21:54.930
<b>**MISSION RECONCILIATION SUCCESSFUL!**</b>

21:59.690 --> 22:01.320
<b>What is it?</b>

22:03.530 --> 22:05.070
<b>I told you so.</b>

22:09.530 --> 22:10.830
<b>Good timing.</b>

22:16.580 --> 22:19.080
<b>They're real phenomena, those two.</b>

22:27.430 --> 22:29.930
<b>Nina Iseri: Rina Momoka Kawaragi: Yûri</b>

22:31.550 --> 22:34.930
<b>Subaru Awa: Mirei Tomo Ebizuka: Natsu</b>

22:35.930 --> 22:39.350
<b>Rupa: Shuri Hina: Reina Kondô</b>

23:43.040 --> 23:46.050
<b>Translation & Subtitling: JSICMF Corrections: Animation Digital Network</b>

23:47.960 --> 23:50.630
<b><i>Next: The Waning Moon Makes an Appearance.</i></b>
